      'dbinsects.guide.bait.h': '🎁 Bait events &amp; trap exclusives',
      'dbinsects.guide.bait.p': 'Six insects are bait-event exclusive — Apollo, White Witch, Rainbow Stag Beetle, Pink Katydid, Chestnut Tiger and Postman Butterfly — and won\'t spawn in the wild. The Sulkowsky\'s Morpho is trap-only, so keep an inflatable trap running.',
