      'dbinsects.guide.t3.h': '🎁 Naniwa loves the rarest bugs',
      'dbinsects.guide.t3.p': 'Gift the Blue Morpho, Hercules Beetle, Death\'s-head Hawkmoth or Large Red Damselfly to Naniwa to raise friendship fast — but hold one for the encyclopedia first.',
      'dbbirds.help': '🐦 How to use the Bird Database',
      'dbbirds.helpText': 'Browse every bird by name, rarity, or required Birdwatching level. Each entry shows the location, weather, and time that species appears. Use the filters to track down a specific bird.',
