      'dbbirds.guide.rules': '<strong>🔭 Three rules to remember:</strong> ❶ Birdwatching unlocks at DG Lv.11 via Bailey J &nbsp; ❷ your Birdwatch level gates which species appear &nbsp; ❸ photographing the same bird repeatedly still builds progress',
