      'redeem.notice': '<strong>⚠️ How this page works:</strong> every code below is cross-checked against an official or reputable source and carries a <strong>source link</strong> and a <strong>verification date</strong>. General/VIP codes that can\'t be traced to a specific official announcement are flagged as "community general codes" — confirm them on Discord before relying on them. Codes are <strong>case-sensitive</strong>, redeemable <strong>once per account</strong>, and can expire without notice — if one no longer works, check the official Discord or X for the newest code.',
