      'beginner.daily.tbl.r5.activity': 'Quests + selling',
      'beginner.daily.tbl.badge.top': 'Highest yield',
      'beginner.daily.tbl.total': 'Total',
      'beginner.daily.tbl.loop': '10-minute loop',
      'beginner.daily.tip1': '&lt;strong&gt;💡 Speed-up tip:&lt;/strong&gt; merge steps ② and ⑤ — while running your gathering route, also locate Albert Jr., then head straight to him to sell after cooking. This saves a trip and compresses the whole routine to 8 minutes.',
      'beginner.daily.tip2': '&lt;strong&gt;📌 If you only have 5 minutes today:&lt;/strong&gt; do ⑤ first (villager quests + selling — highest yield and irreplaceable), then ① (harvest and plant — skip it and you waste growing time); the rest can be skipped.',
      'beginner.dg.eyebrow': 'Fast leveling',
      'beginner.dg.h2': 'How do I level up DG fast?',
      'beginner.dg.intro': 'DG (Development Guild) level = your main progress bar. The core resource for leveling is &lt;strong&gt;contribution medals&lt;/strong&gt;, which come only from the following sources.',
