      'money.raw.fish.note': 'Highlighted rows are above the break-even line and should normally be sold untouched. The two crabs are the exception: their recipes take three of the same crab and still come out ahead. Four more fish tie with Moonfish at 750 — anglerfish, giant oarfish, European flying squid and striped red mullet — all of them sea-fishing catches.',
