      'money.raw.fish.lead': 'Fish &amp; Chips takes 2 fish plus 2 potatoes and sells for 310. Potatoes are worth 90 each if you sell them instead, so the dish only breaks even at <strong>65G a fish</strong> — or <strong>125G</strong> if you count potatoes at their 30G seed cost. Either way, the old "cook anything under 100G" rule of thumb lands roughly in the right place by accident. 58 of the 83 fish we have priced fall under 125G.',
