      'money.raw.fish.decision.sellNever': 'Sell raw, never cook',
      'money.raw.crop.lead': 'Almost every crop sells for about three times its seed — pineapple (3.5×) and carrot (3.1×) run a little higher — so the margin is roughly the same everywhere and the main thing that varies is how long the plot is tied up. Sorted fastest-earning first. Three more crops — paddy, starfruit and lemon verbena — are event-only and have no confirmed sell price, so they are left out.',
      'money.raw.crop.th.crop': 'Crop',
