      'act.sec1.eyebrow': 'Daily Must-Dos',
      'act.sec1.title': 'Recurring &amp;amp; Daily Activities',
      'act.sec1.sub': 'These activities refresh daily/weekly — plan your time to maximize rewards',
      'act.card1.title': '🎣 Sea Fishing Tournament',
      'act.card1.body': 'Twice a day at &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;12:00&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; and &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;21:00&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;Arrive at the beach within 10 minutes to join&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;&amp;lt;span style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:0.82rem"&amp;gt;Players can also spend 2,000 Gold to start one themselves&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;',
      'act.card2.title': '🎟️ Exhibition Gacha',
      'act.card2.body': 'Exhibition Tickets &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;carry over across banners&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;Save them and pull in bulk when the item you want rotates in&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;&amp;lt;span style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:0.82rem"&amp;gt;Duplicates → special exchange vouchers, trade directly for specific items&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;',
      'act.card3.title': '🫧 Dream Bubbles',
      'act.card3.body': '15 pink bubbles refresh &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;every Saturday&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;Hidden across the map, containing exclusive furniture and dye&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;&amp;lt;span style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:0.82rem"&amp;gt;Trigger them by talking to Bailey Jr. and playing the white piano&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;',
      'act.card4.title': '📋 Villager Commissions',
      'act.card4.body': 'Do the &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;5 villager commissions&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; every day&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;Each gives a variable amount of Gold + lots of XP&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;&amp;lt;span style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:0.82rem"&amp;gt;The main source of DG Level XP&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;',
      'act.card5.title': '🏪 Pet Shop Refresh',
      'act.card5.body': 'The adoption line-up &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;refreshes daily&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; — three breeds at a time&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;Come back tomorrow if you\'re not satisfied&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;&amp;lt;span style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:0.82rem"&amp;gt;Keep up to 8 pets (5 cats + 3 dogs)&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;',
      'act.card6.title': '🌧️ Weather-Dependent',
      'act.card6.body': 'Rainy days &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;water crops automatically&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; — no manual work&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;Rainbow weather greatly boosts rare flower spawns&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;&amp;lt;span style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:0.82rem"&amp;gt;Don\'t use the Rainbow Bouquet on rainbow days — stacking wastes it&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;',
      'act.sec2.eyebrow': 'Seasonal Events',
      'act.sec2.title': 'Limited-Time Event Guide',
      'act.sec2.sub': 'Heartopia runs limited-time seasons and collaborations on a rolling schedule, each with its own exclusive items, recipes and furniture. Re-runs are not guaranteed — the events below have all closed on the global server',
      'act.sec2.now': '&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;📌 Currently running:&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; the &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Dave the Diver&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; collaboration (8 Aug – 7 Sep 2026, global). See the archive table below for the full 2026 schedule.',
      'act.winter.badge': 'Ended · 24 Jan – 14 Mar 2026',
      'act.winter.title': '❄️ Winter Frost Season (Fashionwave season)',
      'act.winter.intro': 'A winter limited-time event that unlocks the &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Penguin Stove&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; — an &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;essential&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; for making iced drinks like iced coffee and iced latte. A normal stove can\'t make any iced drink.',
      'act.winter.day0.title': 'Prerequisites',
      'act.winter.day0.body': 'DG Level &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;7&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; and complete the main quest "The Answer Lies Within". Answer Atara\'s call and finish "File Speedrun" to start the preparation phase.',
      'act.winter.day1.title': 'Day 1 → 🎣 Vanya',
      'act.winter.day1.body': 'Complete the Night Fishing Coffee Pot quest. Begin preparing the event.',
      'act.winter.day2.title': 'Day 2 → 🧪 Naniwa',
      'act.winter.day2.body': 'Submit the Omniscient Booster. Keep advancing the preparation progress.',
      'act.winter.day3.title': 'Day 3 → 💰 Mrs Joan',
      'act.winter.day3.body': 'Pay 1,000 Gold. Complete the final round of preparation.',
      'act.winter.day4.title': 'Day 4 → 📝 Opinion Survey',
      'act.winter.day4.body': 'Open the resident opinion survey phase — the event fully kicks off.',
      'act.winter.tip': '&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;⚠️ Key reminder:&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; stock up on the seasonal ingredient &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Frosting&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; daily — Massimo\'s shop caps most base ingredients at &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;50 per day&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;, so buy the full amount every day of the event. White Radish Seeds are the season\'s exclusive seed at the gardening shop. You can also use the shared stove at Massimo\'s café as a Penguin Stove.',
      'act.sec3.eyebrow': 'Past Events',
      'act.sec3.title': '2026 Event Archive (Global)',
      'act.sec3.sub': 'Limited-time seasons and collaborations that have run on the global server since launch, in date order',
