      'act.past.note': 'Dates refer to the global server and are compiled from official announcements and community event trackers; the Chinese server (心动小镇, live since 2024) runs a separate calendar that includes holiday events not yet ported to global.',
      'act.sec4.eyebrow': 'Strategy Tips',
      'act.sec4.title': 'Event Participation Tips',
      'act.tip1.title': 'Plan the Calendar Ahead',
      'act.tip1.body': 'Some seasons open with a &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;multi-day preparation phase&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; gated to one NPC task per day (Winter Frost worked this way) — each day\'s task must be done that day, so a missed day slips the whole schedule. Watch the &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;official Discord&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; announcements before a season goes live.',
      'act.tip2.title': 'Save Up Event Currency',
      'act.tip2.body': '&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Spend Moonlight Crystals and event-exclusive currency on limited banners first&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; to pull exclusive outfits, furniture and vehicles. Don\'t blow them on the standard pool — miss an exclusive and you may wait a year.',
      'act.tip3.title': 'Team Up to Double Efficiency',
      'act.tip3.body': 'Flower breeding &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;requires a friend to water&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; before it triggers. During events, find partners on Discord or the world channel and help each other complete quest goals that need social interaction.',
