      'index.money.eyebrow': '&lt;span class="section-idx"&gt;04&lt;/span&gt;Money Guide',
      'index.money.heading': 'Cooking Profit · From Newbie to Late Game',
      'index.money.sub': 'Remember three rules, then cook at quality and sell the right things — the recipes and rules below are the version that holds up.',
      'index.money.core': '&lt;strong&gt;Three rules that hold up:&lt;/strong&gt; ❶ every priced crop sells for about &lt;strong&gt;3× its seed&lt;/strong&gt; (the outliers: pineapple &lt;strong&gt;3.5×&lt;/strong&gt;, carrot &lt;strong&gt;3.1×&lt;/strong&gt;) — so pick by gold/hour &amp;nbsp; ❷ ★★ = ×1.5 and ★★★ = ×2 the base price on all 73 recipes &amp;nbsp; ❸ avoid the value-destroyers: Grape Jam, Chocolate Sauce and Tuna Sashimi sell for less than their raw materials.',
      'index.money.chartTitle': '🏆 Top dishes by ★★ sell price &lt;span style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-muted);font-weight:400"&gt;(no profit figure — a third of ingredients have no price)&lt;/span&gt;',
      'index.money.chartSub': 'Cook at quality — ★★ is ×1.5 and ★★★ is ×2 the base price, and the biggest seller by far is Steamed Golden King Crab.',
      'index.money.dish1.name': 'Steamed Golden King Crab',
      'index.money.dish1.mats': 'Golden King Crab×3',
      'index.money.dish2.name': 'Steamed King Crab',
      'index.money.dish2.mats': 'King Crab×3',
      'index.money.dish3.name': 'Strawberry Jam',
      'index.money.dish3.mats': 'Strawberry×4',
      'index.money.dish4.name': 'Black Truffle Cream Pasta',
      'index.money.dish4.mats': 'Black Truffle×1 · Wheat×2 · Cream×1',
      'index.money.dish5.name': 'Black Truffle Pie',
      'index.money.dish5.mats': 'Black Truffle×1 · Mushroom×2 · Wheat×2',
      'index.money.tip1.title': '⭐ Best Newbie Start',
      'index.money.tip1.desc': '&lt;strong&gt;Blueberry Jam&lt;/strong&gt; (4 blueberries → 170) and &lt;strong&gt;Fish &amp; Chips&lt;/strong&gt; (2 fish + 2 potatoes → 310) are the honest newbie money-makers: forage-plus-a-fish, no special level, no crop seed.',
      'index.money.tip2.title': '📈 Where the gold is',
      'index.money.tip2.desc': '&lt;strong&gt;Almost every priced crop sells for about 3× its seed.&lt;/strong&gt; Pick by gold per hour: Tomato 80, Potato 60, Wheat 47.5 — not by looking at the sale price. (Pineapple runs 3.5×, carrot 3.1×.)',
      'index.money.tip3.title': '💵 Daily Tasks',
      'index.money.tip3.desc': '&lt;strong&gt;Cook at star quality and sell the right things.&lt;/strong&gt; ★★ is ×1.5 and ★★★ is ×2 the base price on all 73 recipes — no exceptions, so quality is free money.',
      'index.money.tip4.title': '⚠️ Avoid These Pitfalls',
      'index.money.tip4.desc': 'Three recipes &lt;strong&gt;destroy value&lt;/strong&gt;: Grape Jam (4 grapes 1,920 → 220), Chocolate Sauce (1,320 → 240) and Tuna Sashimi (1,700 → 320). Cook them never.',
      'index.money.cta': '📊 Full money guide + recipe profit details ▸',
